flowchart TB
  user[Member opens route] --> view[Thin view requests projection]
  view --> proj[Projection module]
  proj --> port[Data source port]
  port --> adapter[Fixture adapter]
  adapter --> seed[(Seed dataset)]
  seed --> parse[Schema parse and normalise]
  parse --> policy[Role presentation policy]
  policy --> vm[Ordered view model]
  vm --> render[List, detail or retainer view]
  decl[Declare form submitted] --> sim[Declaration simulator]
  sim --> conf[Target time and hotline text]
  conf --> render